  "text": "On the authority of Abu Harayra may Allah be pleased with him, the messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, Let him who believes in Allah and the last day, either speak day, either speak good or keep silent, and let him who believes in Allah and the last day, be generous to his neighbour, and let him who believes in Allah, and the last day, be generous to his guest. It was related by Abu Harayra and Muslim.",
